ures with the help of mechanical parts like joints and thrusters! <br></li><li> Control your creatures' behavior using sensors and neural circuits inspired by electronics!<br> </li><li> Test the capacities of your creatures in lush and beautiful underwater environments!  </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878260/extras/0cda93652aacc7be31536aa1b33950fa.poster.avif?t=1726759626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878260/extras/0cda93652aacc7be31536aa1b33950fa.webm?t=1726759626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878260/extras/0cda93652aacc7be31536aa1b33950fa.mp4?t=1726759626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> SHARE</h2> <br>Share your realistic or whimsical creatures on the Steam Workshop!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878260/extras/3634bfbfc6fd106db6ac90afb83933d9.poster.avif?t=1726759626\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878260/extras/3634bfbfc6fd106db6ac90afb83933d9.webm?t=1726759626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878260/extras/3634bfbfc6fd106db6ac90afb83933d9.mp4?t=1726759626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
